@page "/components/toggle"

<PageTitle>Toggle — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Toggle</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A button that stays pressed — a real <code>&lt;input type="checkbox"&gt;</code>, so it posts
    with the form and survives a fragment swap, announced with <code>aria-pressed</code> because a
    bare checkbox that looks like a button would say the wrong thing.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    The pressed appearance comes from <code>has-[:checked]</code> on the label rather than from
    Radix's <code>data-state="on"</code>, which nothing here would set. That substitution is
    declared in <code>deviations.json</code>, where the parity tests read it.
</p>

